<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/cwe/modeOfIntroduction/647154>	ns2:modeOfIntroductionNote	"REALIZATION: This weakness is caused during implementation of an architectural security tactic." .
<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/cwe/modeOfIntroduction/649172>	ns2:modeOfIntroductionNote	"OMISSION: This weakness is caused by missing a security tactic during the architecture and design phase." .
<http://w3id.org/sepses/resource/cwe/modeOfIntroduction/652154>	ns2:modeOfIntroductionNote	"REALIZATION: This weakness is caused during implementation of an architectural security tactic." .
